# The turn stores, so it has no version. Its reads go up to the store as one arm: the sites answer without running code, numbers are asked for, and what fails takes the turn as it is written.
# RUN: walk f1:Body mechanisms=all
# CHECK: = GetValueAtSiteOrAbsent {{*}} key="n"
# CHECK: testedType=number
# CHECK: = GetValueAtSiteOrAbsent {{*}} key="m"
# CHECK: PropSet {{*}} key="k"
